5,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"Since we need a sustainable plan for the year, we should be thorough. I'll look into the bathroom spray stock and the tin's receipts, as well as the management office rate sheet and billing.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I want to understand the actual time commitment involved. I'll check the stopwatch timing of a full pass and the standard terms of the outside firm to see if outsourcing is viable.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I think it's important to understand the actual distribution of labor and usage. I'll look into a fortnight's watch on kitchen use and the absences on the wall calendar.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,I want to know why the quality of the cleaning is so inconsistent. I'll look into what each housemate counts as done and the bathroom grout after the July scrub.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Midori,,I agree that we need a plan that keeps us all happy. I'll look into the rows recorded in the house chat and the note left by the previous tenants to see what pitfalls we should avoid.,"{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"Since everyone has selected their areas of focus, I believe we have a comprehensive set of data to work with. I'll wait for the findings before we discuss the options.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,I agree. There is no point in speculating on the best arrangement until we have the actual numbers and facts in front of us. Let's see what the data reveals.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,Indeed. A rational decision requires a foundation of evidence rather than assumptions. I look forward to seeing how our individual findings intersect.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,I'm with you all. Let's just get the facts first so we don't waste time arguing over things that might not even be the real problem. I'm curious to see what's actually going on.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Midori,,I feel the same way. It's better to understand each other's perspectives and the history of the house first. I hope the information we find helps us reach a peaceful agreement.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
