59,3,1,talk,Toshio,,"Given the findings, Option B is the most rational. It eliminates the disputes over standards and usage imbalances, provided we establish a transparent system for settling the monthly invoice and supply costs.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I agree. While the outside firm has some inefficiencies, it's the only option that truly removes the time burden from our schedules. A rota or standing assignments still leave us doing the work.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Option B is the only choice that accounts for the disparity in usage and the frequent absences I discovered. It replaces personal resentment with a professional transaction, which is far more sustainable for our harmony.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,May,,"I'm voting for Option B. I can't deal with the stress of guessing if the bathroom is a disaster or fighting over what ""clean"" means. Let's just pay for the peace of mind.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Midori,,I'm voting for Option B as well. It seems like the best way to avoid the arguments and tension that have affected this house before. Let's prioritize our friendship and choose the professional service.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"Since we are all in agreement, there is no need for further debate. I will vote for Option B.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,I'll also vote for Option B. It's the most logical way to ensure the time commitment doesn't interfere with our other responsibilities.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,I concur. Option B is the most equitable solution given the variables of usage and presence. I vote for Option B.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,May,,I'm definitely voting for Option B. It's the only way I can stop stressing about the state of the rooms. Let's just get it settled!,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Midori,,I'm happy we've found a solution we all agree on. I vote for Option B to keep our home a peaceful place for everyone.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
